","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/540704/5407040318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2017/MATRIMONY_COM_LTD-540704-MARCH-2017.PDF","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Matrimony.com Limited released its investor presentation for the quarter and half year ended September 30, 2026. The company reported operational revenue of INR 1,348 Mn and a net profit of INR 207 Mn for Q2-FY27. Management highlighted its market position in online matchmaking, ongoing marketing efforts, and the performance of its matchmaking and marriage services segments. Additionally, the company noted key financial metrics including EBITDA, billing figures, and return ratios. Matrimony.com reported a significant increase in Q1 FY27 consolidated PAT, growing by 127.5% year-on-year, driven by continued growth momentum and deferred revenue from long-term packages.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management expects double-digit growth in Matchmaking billing and revenue on a year-on-year basis in Quarter 2.","quote":"Matchmaking billing and revenue will have a double-digit growth, year-on-year basis in Quarter 2.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"},{"claim":"The company anticipates triple-digit profit growth in Quarter 2.","quote":"Profit will also be triple digit in Quarter 2 as well.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"},{"claim":"Marriage services billing in Quarter 2 is expected to be higher than Quarter 1.","quote":"Marriage services billing is expected to be higher than quarter 1.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"},{"claim":"Sushanta Swain stated that Q2 profit may be at a similar level or slightly better than the current quarter.","quote":"Profit may be similar level of Q1 or slightly better than current quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management expects the growth momentum of new other initiatives and wedding services to pick up and scale in coming quarters.","quote":"However, we expect the new other initiatives, wedding services, growth momentum will pick up this quarter and will scale up in the coming quarters.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company went regional on love.com by launching malayalilove.com.","quote":"We also went regional on love.com. We launched malayalilove.com because Malayalam is one market, where normally the uptake is good.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Matchmaking EBITDA reached Rs. 34.9 crores, representing 26.9% of revenue.","quote":"Matchmaking EBITDA reached Rs. 34.9 crores, which is 26.9%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"},{"claim":"Excluding marketing expenses, margins for the Matchmaking business stood at 63% in Q1.","quote":"Excluding marketing expenses, margins for Matchmaking business is at 63% and compared to in Q4, 59% and a year earlier.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"},{"claim":"On a consolidated basis, the EBITDA margin in Q1 was 20.1%.","quote":"On a consolidated basis, EBITDA margin in Q1 is at 20.1% compared to 12.4% in Q4 and 11% a year ago.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"},{"claim":"Marketing expenses for the Matchmaking business in Q1 were Rs. 46.5 crores.","quote":"Marketing expenses for the Matchmaking business in Q1 were Rs. 46.5 crores compared to Rs. 43.5 crores in Q4 and Rs. 46.7 crores a year ago.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"},{"claim":"The tax rate for the quarter was reported at 23.8%.","quote":"Tax rate for the Quarter 23.8%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"During the quarter, the company added 2.72 lakhs paid subscriptions.","quote":"We added Rs. 2.72 lakhs paid subscription during the quarter, a growth of 15.9% quarter-over-quarter and 3.7% year-on-year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"},{"claim":"The company facilitated over 25,500 success stories during the quarter.","quote":"We facilitated over 25,500 success stories during the quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The cash balance at the end of Q1 was Rs. 342 crores.","quote":"Cash balance at the end of Q1 is Rs. 342 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"},{"claim":"Return on capital employed was stated to be 36.4%.","quote":"Return on capital employed is 36.4%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"},{"claim":"The company is a zero debt company.","quote":"Zero debt company","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a161d2e9-00c4-4388-9770-040cb9d4dd78.pdf"},{"claim":"Cash and investments balance is at INR 3,417 million.","quote":"Our cash & investments balance is at INR 3,417 Mn","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a161d2e9-00c4-4388-9770-040cb9d4dd78.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Share of loss from Astro-Vision, the associate company, was reported at 9 lakhs for the quarter.","quote":"Share of loss from Astro-Vision, our associate company, is 9 lakhs.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA level losses per quarter for marriage services and other businesses were Rs. 3.8 crores.","quote":"EBITDA level losses per quarter was Rs. 3.8 crores as compared to loss of Rs. 5.7 crores in the last quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Management stated they intend to take the wedding services business to a Rs. 100 crore run rate before it contributes to profit.","quote":"And take it to a probably a Rs. 100 crore run rate. Then we can, you know, at that level, it can contribute to the profit also.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"Management noted they may decide whether to take Manyjobs to a national level sometime next year.","quote":"Sometime next year, you may decide when to want to go national level.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=79e618ae-3199-4f7b-be31-f855c28f5667.pdf","timeframe":"next year"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_ppt","concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":21,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":6,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}